 "description": "Score a hero section's five-second clarity across five weighted checks (what you do, outcome, CTA, jargon, subhead) into a 0-100 clarity verdict. See the full version at https://rahuldsarker.co/calculators/above-the-fold-messaging-clarity-grader",
 "inputSchema": {
